    "detailed_description": "Title_Pending is a story based exploration and adventure game. Become a playtester and explore the liminal spaces of a work in progress video game to unravel the mystery behind JMC Gaming Enterprises...<br><br><i>The following text is an excerpt from an email sent out by JMC Gaming Enterprises</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>NOTE FROM THE DEVELOPERS</strong></h2>Hi, my name is Matthew Stanton, and I'm the lead developer at JMC Gaming Enterprises!<br><br>You're here today to help us playtest our new game, {TITLE-HERE}. While you play, I'll be giving insightful developer commentary about how we created the game, and the challenges me and my team faced.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1288900/extras/ced30b5909d51615f8e20f4f5c621140.poster.avif?t=1706223452\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1288900/extras/ced30b5909d51615f8e20f4f5c621140.webm?t=1706223452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1288900/extras/ced30b5909d51615f8e20f4f5c621140.mp4?t=1706223452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Now of course, this <i>is</i> a playtest, and there's a high chance there will be bugs and glitches (especially with the tech department saying they want to test some device during the playtest). But worry not! As a professional game developer, I'll be here to help you through any issues you may encounter.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1288900/extras/68ff2588e4b3d5c2db54b620d49664d1.poster.avif?t=1706223452\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1288900/extras/68ff2588e4b3d5c2db54b620d49664d1.webm?t=1706223452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1288900/extras/68ff2588e4b3d5c2db54b620d49664d1.mp4?t=1706223452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Wait, this is weird, I'm getting some errors here\u2026 I wouldn't worry too much about it, RETCON is a flawless engine after all. I'm sure it's nothing serious.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1288900/extras/8db128bda4c17ae55cff567dcc6fb69e.poster.avif?t=1706223452\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1288900/extras/8db128bda4c17ae55cff567dcc6fb69e.webm?t=1706223452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1288900/extras/8db128bda4c17ae55cff567dcc6fb69e.mp4?t=1706223452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>STORY</strong></h2>In {TITLE-HERE}, [ADD DESCRIPTION LATER CHRIS]<br><br>[SOMEONE GET A GIF OF THE DRIVING MINIGAME]<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2>{TITLE-HERE} features a wide array of movement options. You can walk forwards, backwards, and strafe side to side; a new option available is the run button, allowing players to move faster than they would walking.<br><br><br>[NEED TO GET FOOTAGE]<br><br>If the room you find yourself in is too dark, the flashlight will come in handy, lighting up what you can\u2019t see.<br><br>[DITTO]<br>[Just send without the footage we have like 2 days before the playtest]<br><br>The observant gamers will notice many buttons and switches, some even activate other moving parts in this ground-breaking gaming experience. Coupled with real funky beats found in radios throughout the levels, this will be a game to remember.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>HOW TO JOIN</strong></h2>If this game sounds like your cup of tea, sign up to playtest for JMC Gaming Enterprises now! <br>Contact us ASAP at this number: (061) 219-\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588, or you can reply to this email, and we will arrange a time for you.<br><br>Thank you!<br><br><i>Matt</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>RECOVERED LOG FROM SEPTEMBER 27th</strong></h2><br>The device has gone rogue.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1288900/extras/c0012180c527194078fd2652af94c502.poster.avif?t=1706223452\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1288900/extras/c0012180c527194078fd2652af94c502.webm?t=1706223452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1288900/extras/c0012180c527194078fd2652af94c502.mp4?t=1706223452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "Title_Pending is a story based exploration and adventure game. Become a playtester and explore the liminal spaces of a work in progress video game to unravel the mystery behind JMC Gaming Enterprises...<br><br><i>The following text is an excerpt from an email sent out by JMC Gaming Enterprises</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>NOTE FROM THE DEVELOPERS</strong></h2>Hi, my name is Matthew Stanton, and I'm the lead developer at JMC Gaming Enterprises!<br><br>You're here today to help us playtest our new game, {TITLE-HERE}. While you play, I'll be giving insightful developer commentary about how we created the game, and the challenges me and my team faced.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1288900/extras/ced30b5909d51615f8e20f4f5c621140.poster.avif?t=1706223452\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1288900/extras/ced30b5909d51615f8e20f4f5c621140.webm?t=1706223452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1288900/extras/ced30b5909d51615f8e20f4f5c621140.mp4?t=1706223452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Now of course, this <i>is</i> a playtest, and there's a high chance there will be bugs and glitches (especially with the tech department saying they want to test some device during the playtest). But worry not! As a professional game developer, I'll be here to help you through any issues you may encounter.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1288900/extras/68ff2588e4b3d5c2db54b620d49664d1.poster.avif?t=1706223452\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1288900/extras/68ff2588e4b3d5c2db54b620d49664d1.webm?t=1706223452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1288900/extras/68ff2588e4b3d5c2db54b620d49664d1.mp4?t=1706223452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Wait, this is weird, I'm getting some errors here\u2026 I wouldn't worry too much about it, RETCON is a flawless engine after all. I'm sure it's nothing serious.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1288900/extras/8db128bda4c17ae55cff567dcc6fb69e.poster.avif?t=1706223452\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1288900/extras/8db128bda4c17ae55cff567dcc6fb69e.webm?t=1706223452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1288900/extras/8db128bda4c17ae55cff567dcc6fb69e.mp4?t=1706223452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>STORY</strong></h2>In {TITLE-HERE}, [ADD DESCRIPTION LATER CHRIS]<br><br>[SOMEONE GET A GIF OF THE DRIVING MINIGAME]<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2>{TITLE-HERE} features a wide array of movement options. You can walk forwards, backwards, and strafe side to side; a new option available is the run button, allowing players to move faster than they would walking.<br><br><br>[NEED TO GET FOOTAGE]<br><br>If the room you find yourself in is too dark, the flashlight will come in handy, lighting up what you can\u2019t see.<br><br>[DITTO]<br>[Just send without the footage we have like 2 days before the playtest]<br><br>The observant gamers will notice many buttons and switches, some even activate other moving parts in this ground-breaking gaming experience. Coupled with real funky beats found in radios throughout the levels, this will be a game to remember.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>HOW TO JOIN</strong></h2>If this game sounds like your cup of tea, sign up to playtest for JMC Gaming Enterprises now! <br>Contact us ASAP at this number: (061) 219-\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588, or you can reply to this email, and we will arrange a time for you.<br><br>Thank you!<br><br><i>Matt</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>RECOVERED LOG FROM SEPTEMBER 27th</strong></h2><br>The device has gone rogue.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1288900/extras/c0012180c527194078fd2652af94c502.poster.avif?t=1706223452\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1288900/extras/c0012180c527194078fd2652af94c502.webm?t=1706223452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1288900/extras/c0012180c527194078fd2652af94c502.mp4?t=1706223452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
